&lt;h2 id=&#34;slotted-gatepost&#34;&gt;Slotted Gatepost
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/emsworthy-to-holwell-tor/14.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1000&#34;
	height=&#34;750&#34;
